<title>NEW ZEALAND: PDL ups year profit by 22.9 percent.</title>
<headline>PDL ups year profit by 22.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to March 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 12.53 vs 10.196</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				92.12 vs 75.01</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 20.0 vs 13.0</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		40.0 vs 40.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				  331.17 vs 313.26</p>
<p>    Abnormals after tax		     1.35 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			    16.86 vs 17.45</p>
<p>    Tax					   4.33 vs 5.91</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 13.37 vs 13.37</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date August 8</p>
<p>Reg date August 1</p>
<p>    Ex div   August 4</p>
<p>Note - PDL Holdings Ltd is a plastics and electronics manufacturer.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
